<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 42-day seasonal bills yield 6.914 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ 42-day seasonal bills yield 6.914 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average successful yield on NZ$150 million of 42-day seasonal treasury bills at Tuesday's tender was 6.914 percent, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$250 million.</p>
<p>The weighted average successful yield on $150 million of 71-day seasonal treasury bills was 6.906 percent, with bids totalling $305 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
